# Cloudflare Pages headers.

# Baseline security headers on every response. DELIBERATELY NO content CSP
# (default-src / script-src / style-src / connect-src): a content CSP would break
# the inline JSON-LD, inline styles, Google Fonts, and the cross-origin POSTs to
# scdesign-wirral.vercel.app + q-cbuild1.vercel.app. If a content CSP is ever
# added it MUST allow-list: fonts.googleapis.com + fonts.gstatic.com (style/font),
# 'unsafe-inline' (JSON-LD + inline styles), and connect-src those two vercel.app
# origins — or the live site breaks. HSTS starts SHORT (no includeSubDomains, no
# preload) until every scdesignwirral.co.uk subdomain is confirmed HTTPS-only;
# raise max-age (and consider includeSubDomains/preload) only after that audit.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=300

# Admin portal: never cache the app shell, scripts or styles (always run the
# latest code / show live data) and never allow framing (clickjacking on the
# PII-bearing views). More-specific rules override the /* values above.
/admin
  Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
/admin/*
  Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
